 "Remover também a interface {name} do MikroTik (com o IP e a regra de firewall criados pelo painel)?\n\nOK = remover do MikroTik também\nCancelar = só tirar do painel": "Also remove interface {name} from the MikroTik (with the IP and firewall rule created by the panel)?\n\nOK = remove from the MikroTik too\nCancel = only remove from the panel",
